The Tree of Life, essential to life on the Pristonian continent, is freezing. The Winter fairy, Glacies, came to the continent to find the cause. She found the sources of the glacial river and ended up fighting the Snow Lady, saved at the last instant by the Lady of Spring, the fairy Branwen.

We need to lure the Snowstorm Dragon and the Snow Lady out of their refuges to destroy the sources.
First, we need to get a Kelvezu Egg.

Activate the Incubator in the marked area and defeat Kelvezu to obtain the Kelvezu Egg. A light will mark the right place.

Come back here when you are done.
